<title>KENYA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT KENYA IN FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT KENYA IN FOUR-NATION TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Kenya by four wickets in a four-nations tournament match on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 148 all out in 47 overs, Pakistan 149 for six.</p>
</text>
